  "notes": "Map colors only feed the map item's renderer, and world.conf maps = off leaves no caller: no map renderer exists in the native engine, so the whole class is not needed. The MATERIALS table in blocks.h carries no map-color column. idxaudit 2026-09-27: scope reason rewritten and scope relabeled not_needed -> switched_off.",
  "scope_reason": "Only the map renderer samples block map colours (Block.getMapColor, ItemMap.updateMapData), and world.conf maps = off stops every map from drawing (ItemMap.java:241)."
